We keep prices as whole cents, so here is a helper first.

sub price_str {
    my ($cents) = @_;
    return sprintf('$%d.%02d', $cents / 100, $cents % 100);
}

We start with two coffees. my $coffee = 1299;
and one mug. my $mug = 850;
then we add two coffees and a mug. my $total = 2 * !-2 + !-1;
and we print the total. print "total: ", price_str(!-1), "\n";
